{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Uniform &amp; Bunny Outfit&quot; DLC</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This DLC introduces a vibrant set of high school uniforms\u2014girl dons a classic sailor outfit, while boy sports a crisp white shirt with tailored trousers, capturing the fresh and youthful spirit of school life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Also included are two exclusive bunny-themed outfits for girl, blending Eastern tailoring with Western fashion. Inspired by high school marching band uniforms, the design balances cuteness with a bold, confident flair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each of the four characters comes with their own unique action poses and exclusive decals, usable in combat scenes to enhance their individuality and charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cui Lin High School Sailor Suit &amp; Graceful</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547950/extras/eb438c86cd0377caf7d50b5b89d85ac3.poster.avif?t=1751368742\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547950/extras/eb438c86cd0377caf7d50b5b89d85ac3.mp4?t=1751368742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Huo Wang High School Uniform &amp; Lin Feng</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547950/extras/67a0a4e5c46e3da667e2c3a3e1278a45.poster.avif?t=1751368742\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547950/extras/67a0a4e5c46e3da667e2c3a3e1278a45.mp4?t=1751368742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cui Lin Bunny Outfit (Pink) &amp; Tian Xiang</p><p class=\"bb_parag